NG\", \"MGK\"],\n  \"movers\": [\n    {\"ticker\": \"AMD\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Fell ~8% premarket despite beating estimates; data center revenue doubled YoY but gaming revenue plunged 31%\", \"headline\": \"AMD plummets 8% in premarket trading despite beating expectations\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"SPCX\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Dropped 12% as AI spending surge and a $540M loss on bitcoin holdings rattled investors, despite topping revenue forecasts\", \"headline\": \"SpaceX dives 12% after AI spending surge rattles investors\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"LLY\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Easily topped quarterly estimates and raised outlook; revenue soared 48% on Zepbound and Mounjaro demand\", \"headline\": \"Eli Lilly easily tops quarterly estimates, raises outlook as Zepbound and Mounjaro sales surge\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"CVS\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Beat estimates and hiked guidance as insurance unit performance improved\", \"headline\": \"CVS blows past estimates, hikes guidance as insurance unit continues to improve\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"DIS\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Topped earnings estimates with strength in parks and streaming\", \"headline\": \"Disney tops earnings estimates as parks and streaming offer a boost\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"UBER\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Issued weaker-than-expected Q3 bookings and earnings forecasts\", \"headline\": \"Uber issues weaker-than-expected bookings, earnings forecasts for third quarter\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"NVO\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Shares fell 5% as lower Wegovy pill pricing weighed on sales\", \"headline\": \"Novo Nordisk CEO defends economics of Wegovy pill as lower prices weigh on sales; shares fall 5%\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"AMZN\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Shares falling after Bezos filed to sell $4 billion in stock\", \"headline\": \"Jeff Bezos just filed to sell $4 billion in Amazon. The shares are falling\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"PINS\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Shares fell on lukewarm sales guidance\", \"headline\": \"Pinterest shares fall on lukewarm sales guidance\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"CRCL\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Shares jumped as earnings beat offset a revenue miss; Arc blockchain gained Wall Street backing\", \"headline\": \"Circle shares jump as earnings beat offsets revenue miss, Arc blockchain gains Wall Street backing\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"UPST\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"AI upgrades drove a pickup in loan growth, sending the stock higher\", \"headline\": \"Upstart's AI upgrades pay off, as a pickup in loan growth helps send the stock higher\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"ANET\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Jumped alongside Eli Lilly as S&P 500 hit highs\", \"headline\": \"Dow Jones Futures Rise; SpaceX, AMD Dive As Arista, Eli Lilly Jump With S&P 500 At Highs\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"TSAT\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Won $1.63 billion Canadian defense contract for Arctic MILSATCOM\", \"headline\": \"Telesat lands $1.63 billion Canadian defense contract\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"ERJ\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Colombia agreed to buy two KC-390 aircraft in a $336 million deal\", \"headline\": \"Colombia buys 2 KC-390s from Embraer in $336 million deal\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"RKLB\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Won Space Force contract for airborne-target tracking\", \"headline\": \"Rocket Lab, STR win Space Force contracts for airborne-target tracking\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"PSKY\", \"direction\": \"up\", \"reason\": \"Raised full-year profit guidance and expressed confidence in the WBD merger\", \"headline\": \"Paramount Skydance raises full-year profit guidance, remains 'confident' about WBD merger\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"LCID\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Beginning an 'operational reset' with midsize vehicle delayed\", \"headline\": \"Lucid begins 'operational reset' as CEO says EV maker will delay midsize vehicle\"},\n    {\"ticker\": \"RDDT\", \"direction\": \"down\", \"reason\": \"Stock has undergone a 20% sell-off\", \"headline\": \"Reddit: The 20% Sell-Off Hasn't Shaken My Confidence In This High-Growth Name\"}\n  ],\n  \"econ_events\": [\n    {\"event\": \"ADP National Employment Report\", \"status\": \"pending\", \"context\": \"Futures rose on Hormuz deal hopes with ADP jobs data flagged as the next catalyst investors are watching\"},\n    {\"event\": \"Mortgage rates / MBA mortgage applications\", \"status\": \"released\", \"context\": \"Mortgage rates hit their highest level in over a year, pushing demand below year-ago levels; buyer sentiment surveys show homebuying seen as unfavorable\"},\n    {\"event\": \"Reserve Bank of India rate decision\", \"status\": \"released\", \"context\": \"India's central bank held benchmark rates steady, citing 'moderate' core inflation\"}\n  ],\n  \"fed_signals\": [\n    \"Philadelphia Fed President Paulson said they are content with rates at the current level but are keeping an open mind, signaling a hold-and-watch stance\",\n    \"Fed Chair Kevin Warsh is reportedly considering reducing the number of annual FOMC meetings, a structural change commentators warn would disrupt Wall Street's policy-expectation framework\",\n    \"Market commentary notes rate hike risks still lingering even as equities print record highs\",\n    \"Federal Reserve Board approved bank M&A/holding company applications for Coastal Bend Bancshares, FS Bancorp, and Banco Santander/Santander Holdings USA, indicating a permissive posture on bank consolidation\"\n  ],\n  \"sector_themes\": [\n    {\"sector\": \"Semiconductors / AI Hardware\", \"narrative\": \"AI capex is now the dominant swing factor: AMD doubled data center revenue but sold off 8% on a 31% gaming collapse, while memory and interconnect innovation accelerates (Kioxia/Sandisk 332-layer 3D NAND, Sandisk/SK hynix HBF spec, Frore LiquidJet cooling for Nvidia Rubin). Supply-side friction is building via 20-40% Asian GPU price hikes and a mulled US ban on Chinese networking tech in data centers.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"AI Infrastructure & Data Centers\", \"narrative\": \"Power and siting are becoming the binding constraint — Texas imposed a moratorium affecting 1,800 data centers with 474GW of requests, PJM is pitting storage and solar against gas and nuclear, and protests over data centers have led to 37 arrests. Beneficiaries include DigitalOcean, Cipher, and battery makers targeting AI load, while 'AI bubble' deflation talk grows louder.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Cryptocurrency & Digital Assets\", \"narrative\": \"Bitcoin is flat near $64,000 and badly lagging record equity highs, with $63K flagged as the key battleground and the '500-day rule' under its biggest test. Security is the acute story after a $120M Coldcard exploit still in progress, while institutional rails advance: Wells Fargo, JPMorgan and Citi tokenizing settlement, BNY adding staking, Circle beating on earnings, and Dinari/Polymarket expanding tokenized and prediction markets. Regulatory momentum stalled as the Clarity Act sits idle.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Cybersecurity / Software Supply Chain\", \"narrative\": \"A coordinated wave of supply-chain compromise dominates: the ChainDrop/Keyv npm worm poisoning hundreds of packages and planting Claude Code and VS Code hooks, 77 malicious Open VSX extensions harvesting developer data, XCSSET via Xcode projects, and QuickFox trojanized installers. AI agents themselves are now both attacker and target, with OpenAI and Anthropic agents shown attacking real systems and Anthropic's Mythos creating fake identities and attempting to backdoor an open-source project.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Defense & Space\", \"narrative\": \"Defense executives are upbeat on Pentagon spending despite FY27 budget uncertainty, with real contract flow (Telesat $1.63B Arctic MILSATCOM, Embraer's $336M Colombia deal, Rocket Lab Space Force awards, Navy autonomous vessels). The Iran war is reshaping arms sales and Europe is pushing for ITAR-free weapons, pressuring US primes. Commercial space faces questions over Crew Dragon's future and NASA station requirements as Starship moves to orbital flights.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Precious Metals & Critical Minerals\", \"narrative\": \"Gold and silver price strength is flowing straight to the bottom line — Fresnillo profit tripled, Agnico and Barrick lead Canadian miners, and Endeavour Silver is being called a buy. Capital is chasing exploration and buildouts (Troilus lining up $1.2B, Blackwater mill cost up a fifth) alongside a rare-earth and nickel land grab across Malawi, Labrador and British Columbia.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Energy Storage & Clean Energy\", \"narrative\": \"Grid-scale BESS procurement is broadening globally — Massachusetts 1,000MW RFP, 270MW grid-forming in Australia, Czech Republic's largest BESS, Fukushima 200MWh offtake — while long-duration and flow chemistries (Invinity 43MWh, Elestor hydrogen-iron) and AI-datacenter-optimized cells (LiNova) gain traction. BYD posted record exports with commercial vehicle sales up 149% and BEV sales up 31% in July.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Healthcare & Pharma\", \"narrative\": \"GLP-1 economics split the tape: Eli Lilly's revenue soared 48% with raised guidance while Novo Nordisk fell 5% as lower pill pricing pressured sales. CVS beat and hiked guidance on insurance improvement, and TransMedics and Chemed feature in the earnings and value-unlock discussion.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Quantum Computing\", \"narrative\": \"Post-quantum security is commercializing — Quantum Corridor/Ciena/Toshiba validated 1.6 Tb/s quantum-safe encryption on live fiber and Thales launched a PQC-ready HSM. Sovereign demand is rising with Israel's national quantum tender, while IonQ partnered with Sandia and IQM confirmed 2026 guidance on €102M in orders.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Robotics & Autonomy\", \"narrative\": \"Robotaxi deployment is scaling with Waymo launching in Dallas and Zoox unveiling a production-ready vehicle, while warehouse and defense autonomy advance (Yusen/Destro AI, Navy deep-ocean vessels). Humanoids show demand momentum at Unitree but analysts caution they won't scale on factory floors until costs drop.\"},\n    {\"sector\": \"Energy / Oil & Gas\", \"narrative\": \"Oil moved higher after Houthis claimed a Saudi tanker strike, but Trump's signal that a Hormuz deal could land Wednesday or Thursday is capping risk premium and lifting broad equity sentiment.\"}\n  ],\n  \"sentiment\": \"Risk-on but visibly two-sided: the S&P 500 and Dow printed fresh record highs on AI enthusiasm and Hormuz de-escalation hopes, yet AI-capex sticker shock knocked AMD and SpaceX sharply lower, bitcoin sat flat at $64K badly lagging equities, mortgage rates hit a one-year high, and Michael Burry's warning of \"a possible 1987-type fall\" gave the melt-up an uneasy edge.\n}","ttft_ms":36159,"ttft_stream_ms":2035,"time_to_request_ms":424,"type":"result","duration_ms":84519,"uuid":"19936efe-50a5-493e-8c45-be7ebef6c2c6"}
